{'symbol': 'HD', 'date': '2023-03-06 09:00:00', 'title': 'THE HOME DEPOT FOUNDATION TO GRANT $200,000 IN TRADE SCHOOL SCHOLARSHIPS FOR WOMEN IN CONSTRUCTION', 'text': "PATH TO PRO SCHOLARSHIPS SEEK TO PROPEL MORE WOMEN INTO SKILLED TRADES CAREERS ATLANTA , MARCH 6, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE HOME DEPOT FOUNDATION ANNOUNCED AN INVESTMENT OF $200,000 IN TRADE SCHOOL SCHOLARSHIPS FOR WOMEN, IN CELEBRATION OF WOMEN IN CONSTRUCTION WEEK (MARCH 5-11). THE HOME DEPOT FOUNDATION'S PATH TO PRO SCHOLARSHIP FOR WOMEN WILL PROVIDE $4,000 IN FINANCIAL ASSISTANCE TO WOMEN ENTERING OR CURRENTLY ENROLLED IN CONSTRUCTION TRADES PROGRAMS."}